    "created": "2026-08-03",
    "notes": "Every vector was replayed through the C oracle (tools/oracle-c/dmoracle.exe, compiled from the ORIGINAL src/double_metaphone.c with cl.exe) on 2026-08-03: 113 candidates, 113 kept, 4 corrected to the oracle's output (oracle wins), 0 dropped. primary/secondary hold ORACLE-RAW codes (empty string = empty code); consumers apply wrapper semantics on top (primary == secondary -> secondary None; empty code -> None). Vector words are ASCII-only single tokens: Latin-1 byte arms are covered by native latin1 tests via dmetaphone_bytes, and whitespace-in-word by native tests (PowerShell pipes cannot transport raw Latin-1 bytes faithfully)."
